,"desc":"普攻\n进行最多4段的连续攻击，造成湮灭伤害。\n \n重击\n消耗耐力，造成湮灭伤害。\n若长按普攻，则进入磐岩守势状态。\n \n磐岩守势\n·桃祈受到的伤害降低35%；\n·若磐岩守势期间桃祈受到攻击，将会自动施放后发制人；\n·磐岩守势持续3秒后，将会自动施放后发制人；\n在施放共鸣技能固若金汤时若受到攻击，将会自动施放后发制人。\n \n后发制人\n攻击目标，造成湮灭伤害。\n \n空中攻击\n消耗耐力进行空中下落攻击，造成湮灭伤害。\n \n闪避反击\n成功闪避后一定时间内短按普攻，将会攻击目标，造成湮灭伤害。","descEn":"Basic Attack\nPerform up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing Havoc DMG.\n \nHeavy Attack\nConsume Stamina to deal Havoc DMG.\nHold Basic Attack to enter Rocksteady Defense.\n \nRocksteady Defense\n- Taoqi's damage taken is reduced by 35%;\n- When Taoqi is attacked during Rocksteady Defense, she will cast Strategic Parry;\n- Strategic Parry is automatically cast after Rocksteady Defense lasts for 3s;\nIf Taoqi is attacked when casting Resonance Skill Fortified Defense, Strategic Parry is automatically cast.\n \nStrategic Parry\nAttack the target, dealing Havoc DMG.\n \nMid-Air Attack\nConsume Stamina to perform a Plunging Attack while in mid-air, dealing Havoc DMG.\n \nDodge Counter\nUse Basic Attack after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing Havoc DMG.","params":[{"label":"第一段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 1 DMG","values":["45.34%","49.06%","52.78%","57.99%","61.7%","65.98%","71.93%","77.88%","83.83%","90.15%"]},{"label":"第二段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 2 DMG","values":["42.67%","46.17%","49.67%","54.57%","58.07%","62.09%","67.69%","73.29%","78.89%","84.84%"]},{"label":"第三段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 3 DMG","values":["56%","60.6%","65.19%","71.62%","76.21%","81.49%","88.84%","96.18%","103.53%","111.34%"]},{"label":"第四段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 4 DMG","values":["136%","147.16%","158.31%","173.92%","185.07%","197.9%","215.74%","233.58%","251.43%","270.39%"]},{"label":"重击攻击伤害","labelEn":"Heavy Attack DMG","values":["110.84%","119.93%","129.02%","141.75%","150.84%","161.29%","175.83%","190.37%","204.91%","220.37%"]},{"label":"重击时伤害减免","labelEn":"Heavy Attack DMG Reduction","values":["35%","35%","35%","35%","35%","35%","35%","35%","35%","35%"],"kind":"nonDamagePercent"},{"label":"后发制人伤害","labelEn":"Strategic Pa