ardness":[1.0],"formulaType":0,"subType":[],"damageIds":[1601061001],"confidence":"high"}],"concertoGain":10.0,"confidence":"high","skillIcon":"assets/skills/1000906.webp?v=8e3a394b1cc0"},{"id":1000907,"type":6,"typeName":"共鸣回路","typeNameEn":"Forte Circuit","name":"攻防转换","nameEn":"Power Shift","maxLevel":10,"desc":"御反之隙\n拥有【刚柔化势】时，施放重击后发制人或变奏技能携攻守阵后一定时间内，短按普攻，可施放御反之隙。\n进行最多3段的连续攻击，造成湮灭伤害，此次伤害为普攻伤害。\n御反之隙命中目标时消耗1点【刚柔化势】，同时获得护盾。\n在施放变奏技能携攻守阵后使用普攻，可直接施放御反之隙。\n \n刚柔化势获取规则\n【刚柔化势】上限3点。\n第4段普攻会消耗桃祈所有的【磐岩护壁】，并获得同等数量的【刚柔化势】。\n磐岩护壁持续期间，队伍中登场角色受到攻击时，消耗1个【磐岩护壁】，回复【刚柔化势】。\n磐岩护壁结束后，会消耗剩余的【磐岩护壁】，并获得等同数量的【刚柔化势】。","descEn":"Timed Counters\nWhen carrying \"Resolving Caliber\", use Basic Attack after Heavy Attack Strategic Parry or Intro Skill Defense Formation to cast Timed Counters, performing up to 3 consecutive attacks, dealing Havoc DMG, considered as Basic Attack DMG.\nTimed Counters consume 1 \"Resolving Caliber\" upon hitting an enemy to grant a shield.\nAfter casting the Intro Skill Defense Formation, use Basic Attack to directly cast Timed Counters.\n\nResolving Caliber\nTaoqi can hold up to 3 Resolving Caliber.\nBasic Attack 4 will consume all of Taoqi's \"Rocksteady Shields\" to grant that many \"Resolving Caliber\".\nWhile Rocksteady Shield exists, when the active character is attacked, 1 \"Rocksteady Shield\" will be consumed to recover \"Resolving Caliber\".\nAfter Rocksteady Shield ends, all remaining \"Rocksteady Shield\" will be consumed to grant that many \"Resolving Caliber\".","params":[{"label":"御反之隙第一段伤害","labelEn":"Timed Counters Stage 1 DMG","values":["43.36%","46.92%","50.47%","55.45%","59%","63.09%","68.78%","74.47%","80.16%","86.2%"]},{"label":"御反之隙第二段伤害","labelEn":"Timed Counters Stage 2 DMG","values":["55.8%","60.38%","64.95%","71.36%","75.93%","81.19%","88.51%","95.83%","103.16%","110.93%"]},{"label":"御反之隙第三段伤害","labelEn":"Timed Counters Stage 3 DMG","values":["73.14%","79.14%","85.14%","93.53%","99.53%","106.43%","116.02%","125.62%","135.22%","145.41%"